    "description": "Family of electromagnetic flow meters intended for the metering of cold water. Covers nominal diameters DN25 to DN200 (10 nominal diameters). Designed for a nominal pressure of 16 bar and a maximal water temperature of 60 °C. Measures the flow of electrically conductive mediums (water) by means of the electromagnetic flow measuring system; the conductive medium flows through a magnetic field which induces a voltage proportional to the mean flow speed. The converter of the sensor manages the input and output signals and converts the data. Versions: compact flow meter (converter and flow sensor fixed together) and split version (converter and flow sensor connected via cable). Accessory components: none."
